1. Tap Aether Hub, pay 1 energy counter to add {R}
2. Tap a Scattered Grove to add {G}
3. Cast Khenra Charioteer for {R}{G} (costs {1}{R}{G} but Monument reduces green spells by {1})
4. Rhonas's Monument ability triggers - boost Longtusk Cub with +2/+2 and trample (making it 5/5)
5. Declare attacks with all creatures: Rhonas, Khenra Charioteer, Longtusk Cub, and Greenbelt Rampager
6. All creatures now have trample. In any blocking scenario, the combination of deathtouch on Rhonas, trample on all creatures, and excess power ensures 12+ damage reaches the opponent's face
